    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1887360/extras/d9494fa5043b8257e370c7a643ddff35.webp?t=1742006236\" /></div>D-FACTOR Features innovative gameplay with a FIGHTING GAME visualization and fast-paced turn-based gameplay. Enjoy its incredible MANGA-style illustrations, finish the game with each character to discover part of their story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1887360/extras/03ff8cc40afe5085cf4415fd336b8fbf.poster.avif?t=1742006236\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1887360/extras/03ff8cc40afe5085cf4415fd336b8fbf.webm?t=1742006236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1887360/extras/03ff8cc40afe5085cf4415fd336b8fbf.mp4?t=1742006236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1887360/extras/c89a08e88b825b8ec1ee8345e40fc625.webp?t=1742006236\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Select one of 12 playable characters to unlock their endings and hidden characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1887360/extras/b26749b2412a9bf859db6e58c074555a.poster.avif?t=1742006236\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1887360/extras/b26749b2412a9bf859db6e58c074555a.webm?t=1742006236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1887360/extras/b26749b2412a9bf859db6e58c074555a.mp4?t=1742006236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game design with MANGA style!! not comic!! SLEEVE!! to the Japanese</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beautiful graphics</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Frantic gameplay!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">12 characters to select!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2 game modes, NORMAL or SPECIAL</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2 Difficulties, NORMAL or DIFFICULT</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Characters to unlock</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hidden characters</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1887360/extras/9773c8dbde1f31cbfc9c2ffe0ace8faa.webp?t=1742006236\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1887360/extras/06d10cb20dc1ba623d4bc20d99baf005.poster.avif?t=1742006236\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1887360/extras/06d10cb20dc1ba623d4bc20d99baf005.webm?t=1742006236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1887360/extras/06d10cb20dc1ba623d4bc20d99baf005.mp4?t=1742006236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1887360/extras/b3fc80161d81d0d8f24cf9882f578cf5.poster.avif?t=1742006236\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1887360/extras/b3fc80161d81d0d8f24cf9882f578cf5.webm?t=1742006236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1887360/extras/b3fc80161d81d0d8f24cf9882f578cf5.mp4?t=1742006236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">STORY AND SURVIVE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In STORY mode, you face enemies one-on-one in turn-based combat. In SURVIVE, you must move around the map collecting cards to improve your stats; bosses are defeated in turns.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1 unique ability for each character.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Super attacks for each character.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Haruky has a transformation and a new final boss.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">New Mini Game Mode\u00a0SURVIVE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survive the waves of enemies to face the bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Level up your skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defeat bosses in classic mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1887360/extras/47f60c556e3611d8b6bc49a077811454.poster.avif?t=1742006236\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1887360/extras/47f60c556e3611d8b6bc49a077811454.webm?t=1742006236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1887360/extras/47f60c556e3611d8b6bc49a077811454.mp4?t=1742006236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1887360/extras/d9494fa5043b8257e370c7a643ddff35.webp?t=1742006236\" /></div>D-FACTOR Features innovative gameplay with a FIGHTING GAME visualization and fast-paced turn-based gameplay. Enjoy its incredible MANGA-style illustrations, finish the game with each character to discover part of their story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1887360/extras/03ff8cc40afe5085cf4415fd336b8fbf.poster.avif?t=1742006236\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1887360/extras/03ff8cc40afe5085cf4415fd336b8fbf.webm?t=1742006236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1887360/extras/03ff8cc40afe5085cf4415fd336b8fbf.mp4?t=1742006236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1887360/extras/c89a08e88b825b8ec1ee8345e40fc625.webp?t=1742006236\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Select one of 12 playable characters to unlock their endings and hidden characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1887360/extras/b26749b2412a9bf859db6e58c074555a.poster.avif?t=1742006236\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1887360/extras/b26749b2412a9bf859db6e58c074555a.webm?t=1742006236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1887360/extras/b26749b2412a9bf859db6e58c074555a.mp4?t=1742006236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game design with MANGA style!! not comic!! SLEEVE!! to the Japanese</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beautiful graphics</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Frantic gameplay!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">12 characters to select!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2 game modes, NORMAL or SPECIAL</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2 Difficulties, NORMAL or DIFFICULT</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Characters to unlock</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hidden characters</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1887360/extras/9773c8dbde1f31cbfc9c2ffe0ace8faa.webp?t=1742006236\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1887360/extras/06d10cb20dc1ba623d4bc20d99baf005.poster.avif?t=1742006236\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1887360/extras/06d10cb20dc1ba623d4bc20d99baf005.webm?t=1742006236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1887360/extras/06d10cb20dc1ba623d4bc20d99baf005.mp4?t=1742006236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1887360/extras/b3fc80161d81d0d8f24cf9882f578cf5.poster.avif?t=1742006236\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1887360/extras/b3fc80161d81d0d8f24cf9882f578cf5.webm?t=1742006236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1887360/extras/b3fc80161d81d0d8f24cf9882f578cf5.mp4?t=1742006236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">STORY AND SURVIVE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In STORY mode, you face enemies one-on-one in turn-based combat. In SURVIVE, you must move around the map collecting cards to improve your stats; bosses are defeated in turns.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1 unique ability for each character.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Super attacks for each character.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Haruky has a transformation and a new final boss.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">New Mini Game Mode\u00a0SURVIVE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survive the waves of enemies to face the bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Level up your skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defeat bosses in classic mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1887360/extras/47f60c556e3611d8b6bc49a077811454.poster.avif?t=1742006236\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1887360/extras/47f60c556e3611d8b6bc49a077811454.webm?t=1742006236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1887360/extras/47f60c556e3611d8b6bc49a077811454.mp4?t=1742006236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
